/ActualText (Mining is a competition best imagined as a lottery. Each mining computer is like a lottery ticket generator. The more machines you have, the more tickets produced, and the more chances you have at winning the mining lottery. Currently, the bitcoin network runs through a trillion, million lottery tickets every second. )
