/Type /StructElem
/S /H4
/T (Machine efficiency trends have slowed over the last five years. However, there is still some modest room as machines move toward 3-nm chips. Samsung and Block have both announced that they are producing a 3-nm ASIC chip for bitcoin mining. Other manufacturers are also introducing 4-nm chips while most machines currently use 5-nm chips. Chips used for AI are also following a similar trajectory. )
/E (Machine efficiency trends have slowed over the last five years. However, there is still some modest room as machines move toward 3-nm chips. Samsung and Block have both announced that they are producing a 3-nm ASIC chip for bitcoin mining. Other manufacturers are also introducing 4-nm chips while most machines currently use 5-nm chips. Chips used for AI are also following a similar trajectory. )
/Pg 19 0 R
