/T (The Bitcoin Policy Institute is a non-partisan, non-profit think tank researching the impacts of Bitcoin and other emerging monetary networks. Established as a 501\(c\)3, BPI provides educational resources to policymakers while empowering more than a dozen Fellows from across the country to conduct original academic research on cryptocurrency and technology policy issues.)
